* ==========================================================================
* ============================================================================
* fairchild_datasheet_bjt.lib  --  flag: BOTH (native ngspice)
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Alternative, more detailed parameter sets published in datasheets.
* Model names carry a suffix so they do not clash with ltspice_std_bjt.lib.
* ============================================================================

* Source: Fairchild 2N3904/MMBT3904/PZT3904 datasheet "Spice Model" box (2001, Rev A),
*   e.g. https://www.d.umn.edu/~sburns/EE2212/2N3904.pdf
*   "Fairchild pid=23 case=TO92 88-09-08 bam creation"
* NOTE: the datasheet prints "Ise=6.734" (missing f); corrected to 6.734f as in
*   Fairchild's own library.
.model 2N3904_FCS NPN(Is=6.734f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=74.03 Bf=416.4 Ne=1.259
+ Ise=6.734f Ikf=66.78m Xtb=1.5 Br=.7371 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=1
+ Cjc=3.638p Mjc=.3085 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=4.493p Mje=.2593 Vje=.75
+ Tr=239.5n Tf=301.2p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=2 Rb=10)

* Source: Fairchild 2N3906 parameters as quoted on forum.allaboutcircuits.com thread 3030
.model 2N3906_FCS PNP(Is=1.41f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=18.7 Bf=180.7 Ne=1.5 Ise=0 Ikf=80m
+ Xtb=1.5 Br=4.977 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=2.5 Cjc=9.728p Mjc=.5776 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5
+ Cje=8.063p Mje=.3677 Vje=.75 Tr=33.42n Tf=179.3p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=6 Rb=10)

* Source: ngspice model page example (https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/modelparams.html)
*SRC=BC546;BC546;BJTs NPN;Gen. Purpose;65V 100mA
*   National 65 Volt  .5 Amp  260 MHz  SiNPN  Transistor  01-26-1991
.MODEL BC546 NPN (IS=50.7F NF=1 BF=318 VAF=145 IKF=.3
+ ISE=15.9P NE=2 BR=4 NR=1 VAR=24 IKR=.45 RE=1.54 RB=6.17
+ RC=.617 XTB=1.5 CJE=20.8P CJC=8.33P TF=611P TR=138N)
